This patch adds Dibbler and his infamous sausages to NetHack.

Dibbler now has a delicatessen on the Tourist Locate level. The sausages
have several possible effects: food poisoning, vomiting (as with a
rotten egg), experience gain (as with tripe) or gain poison resistance
(a very small chance).

Cursed sausages are more likely to give bad effects, blessed sausages
are more likely to give good ones. Most sausages are generated cursed.
You're also warned about eating one by 'food appraisal'. :-)

The official spelling is "sausage-inna-bun", but "sausage in a bun"
should also be accepted. It should also be properly pluralized, i.e.
"sausages-inna-bun".

This patch will break save/bones compatibility.

Suggestion for some better messages would be welcome, as well as a
better tile (it's basically a meat stick with brown sides). If (when) 
you find any bugs, let me know.

